{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id189484636"}, "name":{"label":"ngocbao.duong"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-08-06T23:22:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"23.31"}, "id":{"label":"10228735082"}, "title":{"label":"Illegal and destroying the local residential area"}, "content":{"label":"Airbnb hosts are flooded tourists into residential building apartments in Saigon which causing several issues, such as trashed outside the front door, broken of buildings facilities…\nSome residential families had to move out since they found not safe for their children stay anymore. Some residents keen to stay and fight back hard with airbnb hosts which causing more trouble for both sides\n\nAlso, short term rental in residential building apartments is illegal in Vietnam. Law enforcement is possible.\n\nBe a responsible traveler, not ignoring tourists, stay in hotels or some landhouse homestay. Please don’t give a hand with commercial airbnb hosts, those aren’t truly local experiences. We want place that we travel to become better not worse", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=401626263&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
